WEBVTT

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:34.176
I witnessed my brothers and my siblings

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.936
continuously stopped and frisked
by law enforcement.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:40.496
I remember my home being raided.

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:44.416
And one of my questions
as a child was, why?

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:45.640
Why us?

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:50.920
Black Lives Matter
offers answers to the why.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:57.376
It offers a new vision
for young black girls around the world

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.336
that we deserve to be fought for,